/users/gumaciel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T00:08:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T00:08:51Z","body":"Yeah, it's another bug:\n\n```\n02-07 20:59:31.197 23359 23491 E poing-godot-admob: java.lang.ClassCastException: java.lang.Long cannot be cast to java.lang.Integer\n02-07 20:59:31.197 23359 23491 E poing-godot-admob:     at com.poingstudios.godot.admob.ads.adformats.Banner.<init>(Banner.kt:55)\n```\nLine 55:\n<img width=\"744\" height=\"287\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7092cecc-a66e-4f1e-976b-3875d65cb669\" />\n\nHowever the dict is: `02-07 20:59:31.195 23359 23491 D poing-godot-admob: dict: {ad_unit_id=ca-app-pub-3940256099942544/2934735716, ad_position=0, ad_size={width=392, height=61}}`\n\nBtw, the `ad_position` is used as an enum: \n\n<img width=\"856\" height=\"366\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39186203-1b36-450d-9d24-f49c1a3b768e\" />\n\n---\n\nGodot GDScript Plugin creation:\n\n<img width=\"984\" height=\"362\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59371bdc-9261-48a5-b6cd-bc2d8d75a6d5\" />\n\n<img width=\"477\" height=\"342\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed41019b-dec1-4e10-9489-6effa443073e\" />\n\n---\n\nI'll create a new Issue for that, this is fixable from our side, but I don't know if is the expected behavior and other plugins can also have some problems.\n\nSorry for the delay, my main PC is broken and I'm with a secundary ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865798182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867468388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115669#issuecomment-3867468388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115669","id":3867468388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mhOJk","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T16:07:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T16:07:03Z","body":"@gumaciel i'm not seeing the issue in your latest update; you just need to change the type from `Int` to `Long`. \n\n[GDScript `Int`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_int.html) are converted to Java `Long` due to their range, that's expected behavior. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867468388/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867523225","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115669#issuecomment-3867523225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115669","id":3867523225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mhbiZ","user":{"login":"gumaciel","id":20030153,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDMwMTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20030153?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel","html_url":"https://github.com/gumaciel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gumaciel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T16:41:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T16:41:45Z","body":"@m4gr3d thank you! This change of getting the value as `Int` was on the plugin since 2023, but no problem, I agree with the change of `Int` to `Long`.\n\nI'm making the update like this:\n\n```kotlin\nprivate val adPosition: Int = (adViewDictionary[\"ad_position\"] as Number).toInt()\n```\n\nThis way the plugin will work on the past versions and new version.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,